<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.">
	<comment>
		<summary location="TextureComponentSwizzle">
			When accessed by a shader, the red/green/blue/alpha channels are replaced
			by the value corresponding to the component specified in r, g, b, and a.
		</summary>
	</comment>
	<group prefix="TextureComponentSwizzle.">
		<comment location="R">
			<summary> The value that replaces the red channel in the shader.</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="G">
			<summary> The value that replaces the green channel in the shader.</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="B">
			<summary> The value that replaces the blue channel in the shader.</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="A">
			<summary> The value that replaces the alpha channel in the shader.</summary>
		</comment>
	</group>
</group>